<title>USA: Eagan, Minn., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Eagan, Minn., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust said it won $6.115 million of Eagan, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 4.99 percent.</p>
